      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description: A continuous realistic movie scene inside the greenhouse shown in <Picture 2>. Use <Picture 1> as the reference for the only woman: preserve her face, short black bob, mustard yellow jacket, teal scarf, charcoal trousers and brown boots. Use <Picture 3> as the reference for the only brass lantern, preserving its shape and arched handle. The white backgrounds in <Picture 1> and <Picture 3> are studio backgrounds used only to show the assets; the entire video takes place in the greenhouse from <Picture 2>. The woman stands to the left of the wooden table, with the lantern resting on the tabletop within her reach. In the first two seconds she looks down at the lantern. She gently reaches with her right hand, takes the handle and lifts the lantern slightly above the table. She holds it briefly, then sets it back in the same place and releases the handle. In the final second she stands relaxed and looks at the lantern. Her left arm rests naturally at her side. Fixed eye-level wide camera, one continuous shot, calm natural movement and soft consistent lighting.\noverall_soundscape: Quiet greenhouse ambience, faint clothing rustle and a soft metal-on-wood contact when the lantern is placed down.\nnon_diegetic_music: None.\n",
